{"ts":"2026-07-12T18:53:06.487Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-qljv"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-527: semantic staleness warning recommends 'pm reindex' which is absent from the base install"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH-527 (2026-07-12, repro with --no-extensions on 2026.7.12): pm search --semantic on a stale index prints 'run pm reindex --mode hybrid', but reindex ships only in optional @unbrained/pm-search-advanced — on a base install the advertised remediation fails with Unknown command reindex, a guaranteed failed-retry loop for agents following printed guidance verbatim. Fix direction: make remediation hints capability-aware — render hints only for commands resolvable in the current runtime configuration, else render the install step first (GH proposal options 1/3; option 2 = shipping a thin base reindex is a scope decision, not required). CLASS: rendered hints must be generated from actual runtime capability/contract state, same family as the pm-mpbb ledger hint-correctness entries (pm-ulqu enum value-domain hints, pm-gdi7 incomplete flag-hint list, pm-b24b platform-correct paths) — audit other package-owned-command hints (calendar/templates/guide/dedupe-audit etc.) at fix time for the same trap."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","cli","gh-issue","hints","search","semantic"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-12T18:53:06.487Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-12T18:53:06.487Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"The staleness warning renders a remediation that is executable in the CURRENT runtime configuration: when @unbrained/pm-search-advanced is absent it says to pm install the package first (or points to the actual base reindex path), when present it keeps the pm reindex --mode hybrid hint; no rendered hint on a base install leads to Unknown command; spec covers both configurations (--no-extensions and with the package)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gdi7","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-12T18:53:06.487Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"fec090718c0ceb416ba336607f007177d91182e0df30eab87b43a97284337142","message":""}
